    },
    {
      "id": "121:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28647:28649"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你走到门边，打开门闩，拉开门。“你好？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28649:28671"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "陌生人上下打量着你。他的脸上毫无表情。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28671:28692"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你好，”他面无表情地说着。他从你肩膀上往屋里看去。“茱莉在家吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28692:28728"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "茱莉，是马克的妻子。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28728:28740"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要询问陌生人是谁，转到 114。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28740:28758"
    },
    {
      "id": "121:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要告诉他茱莉不在，转到 122。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28758:28776"
    }
  ]
}
